// Ch5 B04 "Lanternfall, part 1: the boats" (act1_ch05.md). Letterboxed. 20:00: the crown bell rings
// once and every household sets its boats on the water at its own grave's channel; the light runs
// down the terraces top to bottom in about four seconds (P08, the chapter's gorgeous-and-doomed frame).
// Watch (ADR 0017, the Ch5 row): Asha leads no rite. A Pemakar elder puts a folded boat into her hands
// like any guest's; she floats it at the strangers' channel for her mother, holds it a moment, lets go.
// No speech, no dance, no platform, no staff raised over the water.
// Rhen's boat (ADR 0022 sweep-H): a boat-seller gives him one with its own wick. Camera insert inside
// P09: his hand goes to the tin at his belt where Kell's wick is, stays a moment, and comes away; he
// uses the seller's wick. Kell's wick stays unburned until E7. Nothing names it. The choice sets
// exactly one of three flags (Ch7 reads them; "Not yet" keeps the boat, folded and unlit: the chapter
// flow gives the key item pemakar_leaf_boat).
// P09: the town walks down beside its boats, the party with it. P10, the cold edge: the held motes
// come off the graves and drift sideways and down after the boats, toward the sea. Do not surface it:
// beautiful on a first play, quietly wrong on a replay. Nobody comments.
// If ch05_told_the_smith: an insert of Garo's boat, too big and badly folded, guttering but afloat.
title: ch05_lanternfall_boats
location: ch05/pemakar
---
@letterbox on
@music lanternfall fade=1.0
@camera P08
@sfx crown_bell
@wait 4.0
@anim elder give_boat asha
@wait 0.8
@mark asha strangers_channel walk
@anim asha float_boat
@wait 1.5
@anim boat_seller give_boat rhen
@camera P09
@anim rhen hand_to_tin
@wait 1.2
@anim rhen hand_away
@anim rhen light_seller_wick
@wait 0.8
-> For Mother Kell. #line:ch05_boats_001
    <<set $ch05_boat_for_kell = true>>
    @anim rhen float_boat
-> For Oruvel. #line:ch05_boats_002
    <<set $ch05_boat_for_oruvel = true>>
    @anim rhen float_boat
-> Not yet. #line:ch05_boats_003
    <<set $ch05_kept_leaf_boat = true>>
    @anim rhen fold_boat_away
    Asha [tender]: Then carry it till it's time. #line:ch05_boats_004
@anim rhen procession_walk
@wait 2.0
<<if $ch05_told_the_smith>>
    @camera P09_garo
    @wait 1.5
    @camera P09
<<endif>>
@camera P10
@vfx glimmer_held at=grave_terrace drift=down_seaward rate=slow
@wait 2.0
Rhen [worried]: They're coming with us. #line:ch05_boats_005
Asha [neutral]: They follow the boats down. They always do. #line:ch05_boats_006
Rhen [neutral]: Is that good? #line:ch05_boats_007
@wait 1.0
Asha [soft_smile]: It's what they do. #line:ch05_boats_008
Toma [neutral]: Level preserve them. #line:ch05_boats_009
===
